<div class="uniko-pdp-faq">
  <div class="uniko-pdp-block-inner">
    <h2 class="uniko-pdp-block-title" data-i18n="pdp_faq_title">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <div class="uniko-pdp-faq-list">
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_milk_faq_q1">How do I use Hair Milk Goldy Treasure?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_milk_faq_a1">Apply every morning. You can also use it as a mask, leave-in, or detangler.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_milk_faq_q2">Is it a 3-in-1 product?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_milk_faq_a2">Yes — one creamy milk for daily care, masking, leave-in conditioning and detangling.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_milk_faq_q3">Who can use it?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_milk_faq_a3">Made for men, women and kids — the whole family.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="uniko-pdp-faq-item">
        <summary data-i18n="pdp_milk_faq_q4">Will it help define curls?</summary>
        <p data-i18n="pdp_milk_faq_a4">Its nourishing formula is crafted to help support naturally defined curls with regular use.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="uniko-pdp-compare">
  <div class="uniko-pdp-block-inner">
    <h2 class="uniko-pdp-block-title" data-i18n="pdp_compare_title">How we compare</h2>
    <div class="uniko-pdp-compare-scroll">
      <table class="uniko-pdp-compare-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th scope="col" data-i18n="pdp_cmp_feature">Feature</th>
            <th scope="col" class="is-highlight">{{ product.title }}</th>
            <th scope="col" data-i18n="pdp_milk_cmp_col2">Regular leave-in</th>
            <th scope="col" data-i18n="pdp_milk_cmp_col3">Conventional hair milk</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row" data-i18n="pdp_milk_cmp_row1">3-in-1 (mask / leave-in / detangler)</th>
            <td class="is-highlight"><span class="uniko-pdp-yes">✓</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-no">—</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-maybe" data-i18n="pdp_cmp_sometimes">Sometimes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row" data-i18n="pdp_milk_cmp_row2">Daily morning care</th>
            <td class="is-highlight"><span class="uniko-pdp-yes">✓</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-yes">✓</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-maybe" data-i18n="pdp_cmp_varies">Varies</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row" data-i18n="pdp_milk_cmp_row3">Curl-defining support</th>
            <td class="is-highlight"><span class="uniko-pdp-yes">✓</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-maybe" data-i18n="pdp_cmp_varies">Varies</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-maybe" data-i18n="pdp_cmp_sometimes">Sometimes</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row" data-i18n="pdp_milk_cmp_row4">Whole-family use</th>
            <td class="is-highlight"><span class="uniko-pdp-yes">✓</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-maybe" data-i18n="pdp_cmp_varies">Varies</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-maybe" data-i18n="pdp_cmp_varies">Varies</span></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <th scope="row" data-i18n="pdp_milk_cmp_row5">Aloe + vitamin E blend</th>
            <td class="is-highlight"><span class="uniko-pdp-yes">✓</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-maybe" data-i18n="pdp_cmp_sometimes">Sometimes</span></td>
            <td><span class="uniko-pdp-no">—</span></td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

